# The Brick Pro: its left stick works as the D-pad, and its LEDs page has a Sticks row. There,
# Triggers sets the rear zone and Sticks the rings around the sticks (lr on a Brick Pro).
press a
phase Shelf
stick right
snap shelf-stick
stick left
press menu
phase QuickMenu
stick up      # System, by the stick
press a
press a       # LEDs
snap menu-leds
stick down
stick down
stick down    # Triggers
press right
led max_scale_rear 40
stick down    # Sticks
press right
press right
led max_scale_lr 60
led max_scale 20
press b
press b
press b
phase Shelf
